## What To Check Before Changes

- Dependency chain across architectural layers ({describe yours})
- Module boundaries and unwanted coupling
- DI / configuration impact
- Security-sensitive flows (auth, secrets, encryption)
- State management correctness
- Performance hot paths
- Cross-feature side-effects

